# What is not shipped. REGEXES, not globs - ExtUtils::Manifest matches these
# with m//, so `*.o` is not a pattern that means anything here, it is a syntax
# error waiting to be one.
#
# ignore.txt beside this file is the same list in glob form, and nothing reads
# it: ExtUtils::Manifest looks for MANIFEST.SKIP under that name and no other.
# Without this file every build product counted as a MANIFEST gap, which is a
# good way to stop reading the output of a check that also reports real ones.
^Makefile$
^Makefile\.old$
^blib/
^pm_to_blib$
^MYMETA\.
^Install/
\.o$
\.bs$
^Arena\.c$
^Shared-Arena-
\.tar\.gz$
^\.git
~$
